1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,012
Writing, task two. E-mail number 5: Complaint about shoes.

2
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:19,289
You bought shoes online but there is a problem with them. Write an e-mail to the shop. Write at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

3
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,387
Good afternoon,

4
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:38,598
I bought Nike sports shoes from you, size 43. I bought them online on 2 October.

5
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:44,617
I've only worn them for a week and they're already broken, the left shoe has a hole.

6
00:00:44,933 --> 00:00:47,876
I would like to exchange them for new ones.

7
00:00:48,167 --> 00:00:50,970
I'll send the shoes back to you by post tomorrow.

8
00:00:51,267 --> 00:00:53,153
Thank you for your reply.

9
00:00:53,467 --> 00:01:02,470
This e-mail has 50 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

10
00:01:03,167 --> 00:01:12,739
Write your own e-mail on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
